        "id": 1000019
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-27T05:33:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  Then don\u0027t forget to update it when adding 8bit support.\n`i8` and `u8` are different as we actually can only load and store i8 and u8 subgroup matrix from `array\u003ci32\u003e` and `array\u003cu32\u003e` instead of `array\u003ci8\u003e` and `array\u003cu8\u003e` which are not supported in WGSL.",
      "parentUuid": "d31cb43f_fcf309a9",
